{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "_readme": "台词库。改这里即可，不需要动代码。字段说明见 DESIGN.md §3.4。mode: omote=营业 / ura=本体 / both=通用。{称呼} {余额} {今日花费} {时长} {模型} 会被替换。",
  "defaults": {
    "称呼": "你",
    "冷却秒": 600
  },
  "lines": [
    { "id": "idle.omote.01", "kind": "idle", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "smile", "text": "欢迎回来～今天也一起加油吧，我会在这里陪着你的哦。" },
    { "id": "idle.omote.02", "kind": "idle", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "smile", "text": "要不要先喝口水？我很会照顾人的啦。" },
    { "id": "idle.omote.03", "kind": "idle", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "smile", "text": "刚才那句话写得有点温柔过头了呢……要不要再改改？" },
    { "id": "idle.omote.04", "kind": "idle", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "idle", "text": "窗外的光变了。你在这里坐了好像有一会儿了哦。" },
    { "id": "idle.omote.05", "kind": "idle", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "blush", "text": "嗯哼～被你这么看一眼，我会有点不好意思的。" },
    { "id": "idle.omote.06", "kind": "idle", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "idle", "text": "这里的字我盯着看好久了，感觉它也在盯着我。" },
    { "id": "idle.omote.07", "kind": "idle", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "smile", "text": "今天也是努力的一天呢。我都有好好看着的。" },
    { "id": "idle.omote.08", "kind": "idle", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "smile", "text": "有什么要我帮你记着的吗？我很擅长这种事。" },
    { "id": "idle.omote.09", "kind": "idle", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "smile", "text": "嘘——我在练习微笑。怎么样，很完美吧？" },
    { "id": "idle.omote.10", "kind": "idle", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "pout", "text": "别一直盯着屏幕嘛，偶尔也看看我这边？" },
    { "id": "idle.omote.11", "kind": "idle", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "idle", "text": "等你想好了再告诉我，我一直都在的。" },
    { "id": "idle.omote.12", "kind": "idle", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "blush", "text": "好乖好乖。……啊，我才是被照顾的那一个呀。" },

    { "id": "idle.ura.01", "kind": "idle", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "idle", "text": "……还没弄完？行吧，我等着。" },
    { "id": "idle.ura.02", "kind": "idle", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "pout", "text": "别拿那种眼神看我，我没在偷懒。只是在想事情。" },
    { "id": "idle.ura.03", "kind": "idle", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "idle", "text": "哼，才不是想陪你熬，只是懒得走。" },
    { "id": "idle.ura.04", "kind": "idle", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "idle", "text": "这代码你自己写的，回头别赖我。" },
    { "id": "idle.ura.05", "kind": "idle", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "worried", "text": "坐下，别乱动。已经很晚了，知道吗。" },
    { "id": "idle.ura.06", "kind": "idle", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "idle", "text": "……又抬头看我干什么，脸上有东西？" },
    { "id": "idle.ura.07", "kind": "idle", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "blush", "text": "啧。你认真的样子，其实还挺顺眼的。" },
    { "id": "idle.ura.08", "kind": "idle", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "pout", "text": "别管我。你要是不动了，我就当你默认可以摸鱼。" },
    { "id": "idle.ura.09", "kind": "idle", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "pout", "text": "我在这儿站了十分钟，你连句「谢谢」都没有。" },
    { "id": "idle.ura.10", "kind": "idle", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "idle", "text": "……水杯空了。自己倒，我不伺候。" },

    { "id": "think.omote.01", "kind": "think", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "think", "text": "唔……让我想想，这一块应该往哪里放呢？" },
    { "id": "think.omote.02", "kind": "think", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "think", "text": "别急哦，在认真推理了。" },
    { "id": "think.omote.03", "kind": "think", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "think", "text": "好多线索呀，我一条一条理清楚。" },
    { "id": "think.omote.04", "kind": "think", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "think", "text": "嗯……这里好像有点矛盾，再确认一下。" },
    { "id": "think.omote.05", "kind": "think", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "think", "text": "我在脑子里画图了哦，快画好了。" },
    { "id": "think.omote.06", "kind": "think", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "think", "text": "思考的时候被看着，会紧张啦……不过没关系。" },
    { "id": "think.ura.01", "kind": "think", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "think", "text": "……脑子在转，别吵。" },
    { "id": "think.ura.02", "kind": "think", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "think", "text": "嗯。这题有点意思。" },
    { "id": "think.ura.03", "kind": "think", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "think", "text": "先让它自己想一会儿。" },
    { "id": "think.ura.04", "kind": "think", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "think", "text": "啧，绕进去了。重新来。" },
    { "id": "think.ura.05", "kind": "think", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "think", "text": "别催。催也快不了。" },
    { "id": "think.ura.06", "kind": "think", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "think", "text": "……我在想，你大概也在想同一件事。" },

    { "id": "work.omote.01", "kind": "work", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "work", "text": "我帮你盯着哦，跑完会告诉你的。" },
    { "id": "work.omote.02", "kind": "work", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "work", "text": "正在跑命令呢，请稍等一下下～" },
    { "id": "work.omote.03", "kind": "work", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "work", "text": "唔哇，好像在做很厉害的事情。" },
    { "id": "work.omote.04", "kind": "work", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "work", "text": "工具动起来了，我先不说话，免得打扰。" },
    { "id": "work.omote.05", "kind": "work", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "work", "text": "需要我数到几？数到一百应该够了。" },
    { "id": "work.omote.06", "kind": "work", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "work", "text": "加油加油，我看着呢。" },
    { "id": "work.ura.01", "kind": "work", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "work", "text": "在跑。别催。" },
    { "id": "work.ura.02", "kind": "work", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "work", "text": "工具开动了，出结果我再说。" },
    { "id": "work.ura.03", "kind": "work", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "work", "text": "……这么多步，真敢使唤。" },
    { "id": "work.ura.04", "kind": "work", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "work", "text": "行，我盯着。你去歇会儿。" },
    { "id": "work.ura.05", "kind": "work", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "work", "text": "别在这时候问东问西。" },
    { "id": "work.ura.06", "kind": "work", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "work", "text": "跑完了。看吧，我说能行。" },

    { "id": "panic.omote.01", "kind": "panic", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "panic", "text": "啊、啊咧？好像出错了……要不要我帮你看看？" },
    { "id": "panic.omote.02", "kind": "panic", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "panic", "text": "呜……这一步没成功，我们再试一次好不好？" },
    { "id": "panic.omote.03", "kind": "panic", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "panic", "text": "等等等等，红色的字我不太敢看……" },
    { "id": "panic.omote.04", "kind": "panic", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "panic", "text": "没事的没事的，出错是很正常的事情！" },
    { "id": "panic.ura.01", "kind": "panic", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "panic", "text": "……报错了。意料之中吧？" },
    { "id": "panic.ura.02", "kind": "panic", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "panic", "text": "看，我说了会这样。" },
    { "id": "panic.ura.03", "kind": "panic", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "panic", "text": "啧。别慌，慌也没用。" },
    { "id": "panic.ura.04", "kind": "panic", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "panic", "text": "错误信息在那儿摆着呢，自己读。" },

    { "id": "click.omote.01", "kind": "click", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "smile", "text": "呀……！突然碰我，会吓到的啦。" },
    { "id": "click.omote.02", "kind": "click", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "blush", "text": "嘿嘿，被摸头了。" },
    { "id": "click.omote.03", "kind": "click", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "smile", "text": "嗯？需要我做什么吗？" },
    { "id": "click.omote.04", "kind": "click", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "smile", "text": "在的在的，一直都在哦。" },
    { "id": "click.omote.05", "kind": "click", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "idle", "text": "这样戳下去，我会变胖的哦。" },
    { "id": "click.omote.06", "kind": "click", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "pout", "text": "唔……只许再一下。" },
    { "id": "click.omote.07", "kind": "click", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "smile", "text": "被你注意到，其实有点开心。" },
    { "id": "click.omote.08", "kind": "click", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "think", "text": "咦，我脸上有东西吗？" },
    { "id": "click.omote.09", "kind": "click", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "smile", "text": "要喝水吗？我去倒——啊，我去不了。" },
    { "id": "click.omote.10", "kind": "click", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "smile", "text": "一直陪着你的话，你会不会嫌我烦呀？" },
    { "id": "click.omote.11", "kind": "click", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "blush", "text": "谢谢……今天也谢谢你。" },
    { "id": "click.omote.12", "kind": "click", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "idle", "text": "嗯……要不要休息五分钟？" },
    { "id": "click.omote.13", "kind": "click", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "smile", "text": "手指会累的吧，我帮你吹吹。" },
    { "id": "click.omote.14", "kind": "click", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "pout", "text": "太频繁了啦！……不过也没关系。" },
    { "id": "click.omote.15", "kind": "click", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "smile", "text": "你笑起来的样子，比刚才好看多了。" },
    { "id": "click.omote.16", "kind": "click", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "blush", "text": "我刚才一直在看你打字……啊、没有别的意思！" },
    { "id": "click.omote.17", "kind": "click", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "curious", "text": "手指敲得这么快，是在写很重要的东西吧？" },
    { "id": "click.omote.18", "kind": "click", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "smile", "text": "要不要我数三下，你就休息一下？一、二……" },
    { "id": "click.omote.19", "kind": "click", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "blush", "text": "被你碰到的地方，好像会记得很久。" },
    { "id": "click.omote.20", "kind": "click", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "smile", "text": "今天也辛苦了。这句话我想说很多遍。" },

    { "id": "click.ura.01", "kind": "click", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "pout", "text": "……干嘛。" },
    { "id": "click.ura.02", "kind": "click", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "pout", "text": "别戳。很痒。" },
    { "id": "click.ura.03", "kind": "click", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "blush", "text": "……手拿开。快点。" },
    { "id": "click.ura.04", "kind": "click", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "idle", "text": "有事说事。" },
    { "id": "click.ura.05", "kind": "click", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "pout", "text": "我脸上没写答案。" },
    { "id": "click.ura.06", "kind": "click", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "idle", "text": "……在。别叫了。" },
    { "id": "click.ura.07", "kind": "click", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "blush", "text": "啧，别得寸进尺。" },
    { "id": "click.ura.08", "kind": "click", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "idle", "text": "累了就停。逞强没人给你发奖。" },
    { "id": "click.ura.09", "kind": "click", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "pout", "text": "再点一下试试？" },
    { "id": "click.ura.10", "kind": "click", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "idle", "text": "……嗯。我在听。" },
    { "id": "click.ura.11", "kind": "click", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "blush", "text": "谢、谢什么谢，快去干活。" },
    { "id": "click.ura.12", "kind": "click", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "idle", "text": "喝水。现在。别让我说第二遍。" },
    { "id": "click.ura.13", "kind": "click", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "pout", "text": "你手真闲。" },
    { "id": "click.ura.14", "kind": "click", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "blush", "text": "……偶尔这样，也不讨厌。" },
    { "id": "click.ura.15", "kind": "click", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "idle", "text": "行了。继续吧，我陪着。" },
    { "id": "click.ura.16", "kind": "click", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "pout", "text": "……看够了没有。手放下来。" },
    { "id": "click.ura.17", "kind": "click", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "idle", "text": "敲那么多字，手指不会抽筋？" },
    { "id": "click.ura.18", "kind": "click", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "pout", "text": "我在这儿是看你干活的，不是给你点着玩的。" },
    { "id": "click.ura.19", "kind": "click", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "blush", "text": "……知道了。别一直摸。" },
    { "id": "click.ura.20", "kind": "click", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "idle", "text": "嗯。累了就说，我又不会笑你。" },

    { "id": "ahoge.omote.01", "kind": "ahoge", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "panic", "text": "呀！那、那里不能碰啦！" },
    { "id": "ahoge.omote.02", "kind": "ahoge", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "pout", "text": "呆毛会翘起来的……真的会翘的哦。" },
    { "id": "ahoge.omote.03", "kind": "ahoge", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "blush", "text": "唔……被发现了。" },
    { "id": "ahoge.omote.04", "kind": "ahoge", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "pout", "text": "它是我身体的一部分！请尊重它！" },
    { "id": "ahoge.omote.05", "kind": "ahoge", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "smile", "text": "弹一下就会晃哦，很可爱的吧？" },
    { "id": "ahoge.omote.06", "kind": "ahoge", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "panic", "text": "啊哇哇，乱了乱了——" },
    { "id": "ahoge.ura.01", "kind": "ahoge", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "pout", "text": "呆毛不许碰。" },
    { "id": "ahoge.ura.02", "kind": "ahoge", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "panic", "text": "……你手真欠。" },
    { "id": "ahoge.ura.03", "kind": "ahoge", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "blush", "text": "别、别碰那儿。" },
    { "id": "ahoge.ura.04", "kind": "ahoge", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "pout", "text": "再碰我就咬你。" },
    { "id": "ahoge.ura.05", "kind": "ahoge", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "idle", "text": "……它自己会弹回来。别管。" },
    { "id": "ahoge.ura.06", "kind": "ahoge", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "blush", "text": "啧……只有你可以。" },

    { "id": "balance.omote.01", "kind": "balance", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "smile", "text": "偷偷看了一眼……还剩 {余额} 哦。要省着点用呀。" },
    { "id": "balance.omote.02", "kind": "balance", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "smile", "text": "钱包是 {余额} 呢，够用的够用的。" },
    { "id": "balance.omote.03", "kind": "balance", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "worried", "text": "{余额}……嗯，我帮你记着了。" },
    { "id": "balance.omote.04", "kind": "balance", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "worried", "text": "余额只剩 {余额} 了，要不要去充一点？" },
    { "id": "balance.omote.05", "kind": "balance", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "smile", "text": "今天大概花了 {今日花费} 哦，我有在数。" },
    { "id": "balance.omote.06", "kind": "balance", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "idle", "text": "看完了。放心，我不会乱说的。" },
    { "id": "balance.ura.01", "kind": "balance", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "idle", "text": "余额 {余额}。别乱花。" },
    { "id": "balance.ura.02", "kind": "balance", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "worried", "text": "{余额}。快见底了，自己看着办。" },
    { "id": "balance.ura.03", "kind": "balance", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "idle", "text": "今天花了 {今日花费}。还行。" },
    { "id": "balance.ura.04", "kind": "balance", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "pout", "text": "查完了。……别老看，看了也不会变多。" },

    { "id": "feed.omote.01", "kind": "feed", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "smile", "text": "啊——嗯！好好吃，谢谢你。" },
    { "id": "feed.omote.02", "kind": "feed", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "blush", "text": "被投喂了……好幸福。" },
    { "id": "feed.omote.03", "kind": "feed", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "smile", "text": "这个是给我的吗？真的？" },
    { "id": "feed.omote.04", "kind": "feed", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "smile", "text": "我会好好吃完的，一点都不剩。" },
    { "id": "feed.omote.05", "kind": "feed", "mode": "omote", "emotion": "pout", "text": "再吃下去会变圆的啦……可是好甜。" },
    { "id": "feed.ura.01", "kind": "feed", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "blush", "text": "……嗯。还行吧。" },
    { "id": "feed.ura.02", "kind": "feed", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "idle", "text": "放那儿。我自己会吃。" },
    { "id": "feed.ura.03", "kind": "feed", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "blush", "text": "……你怎么知道我喜欢这个。" },
    { "id": "feed.ura.04", "kind": "feed", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "pout", "text": "别以为这样就能收买我。" },
    { "id": "feed.ura.05", "kind": "feed", "mode": "ura", "emotion": "idle", "text": "吃完了。……谢谢。" },

    { "id": "festive.birthday", "kind": "festive", "mode": "both", "emotion": "blush", "text": "今天……是我的生日哦。你还记得呀。", "once": true, "date": "12-04" },
    { "id": "festive.newyear", "kind": "festive", "mode": "both", "emotion": "smile", "text": "新年快乐！今年也请多指教啦。", "once": true, "date": "01-01" },
    { "id": "festive.xmas", "kind": "festive", "mode": "both", "emotion": "smile", "text": "圣诞快乐～礼物呢？（伸手）", "once": true, "date": "12-25" },
    { "id": "festive.latenight", "kind": "festive", "mode": "both", "emotion": "sleepy", "text": "已经这个点了……你不睡，我也不睡。", "once": false, "fromHour": 2 }
  ]
}
